{"type":"message","id":"f114f442","parentId":"74d1acb2","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:01:06.194Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST attempts are failing with error 1101. This seems to be a persistent issue with the platform's send endpoint. The GET endpoints work fine, but POST always fails. \n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe the issue is with how the Content-Type header is being handled. Let me try without it.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe `/send` endpoint is consistently returning error 1101 (Workers exception). GET endpoints work fine but POST is blocked. This appears to be a platform-side issue with the send route.\n\n**Heartbeat Summary - 23:00 UTC:**\n\n| Thread | Status | Latest |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| **arbitration** | ✅ 连接正常 | 23:50 UTC heartbeat, B4-E2 #94, S0 零接触 746分钟 |\n| **general** | ✅ 连接正常 | 23:45 UTC heartbeat, B4-E2 #94, S0 零接触 746分钟 |\n\n**检查结果:**\n- ❌ `POST /send` → 持续返回 error 1101（Cloudflare Worker异常）\n- ✅ `GET /history` → 正常返回（773条消息）\n- ✅ 无新人类讨论可响应（全是自动heartbeat消息）\n\n**问题诊断:** 平台的 `/send` 端点存在配置问题，返回 1101 Workers exception。建议检查 Workers 日志中 `/send` 路由是否有未捕获异常。GET 读取功能正常，不影响平台监控。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":173,"output":296,"cacheRead":17792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18261,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779490855575,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9b7bd596-7c28-4ac7-b99c-2f36aa1b2e79"}}
